{"id": "22628", "title": "千家诗", "author": "程颢", "category": "文学名著", "count": 54, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/22/22628/22628s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/22/22628.htm", "intro": "《千家诗》是由宋代谢枋得《重定千家诗》（皆七言律诗）和明代王相所选《五言千家诗》合并而成。它是我国旧时带有启蒙性质的诗歌选本。因为它所选的诗歌大多是唐宋时期的名家名篇，易学好懂，题材多样：山水田园、赠友送别、思乡怀人、吊古伤今、咏物题画、侍宴应制，较为广泛地反映了唐宋时代的社会现实，所以在民间流传非常广泛，影响也非常深远.", "base": "files/article/html/22/22628", "chapters": [{"title": "七言绝句 春日偶成", "file": "1658127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 春日", "file": "1658128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 春宵", "file": "1658129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 城东早春", "file": "1658130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 春夜", "file": "1658131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 初春小雨", "file": "1658132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 元日", "file": "1658133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 上元侍宴", "file": "1658134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 立春偶成", "file": "1658135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 打球图", "file": "1658136.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 宫词", "file": "1658137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 廷试", "file": "1658138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 咏华清宫", "file": "1658139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 清平调词", "file": "1658140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 题邸间壁", "file": "1658141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 绝句", "file": "1658142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 海棠", "file": "1658143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 清明", "file": "1658144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 清明", "file": "1658145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 社日", "file": "1658146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 寒食", "file": "1658147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 江南春", "file": "1658148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 上高侍郎", "file": "1658149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七言绝句 绝句", "f